    <item>
      <title>B端产品经理，拼的是「砍项目」？</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260907/B%E7%AB%AF%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E7%BB%8F%E7%90%86%E6%8B%BC%E7%9A%84%E6%98%AF%E7%A0%8D%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE/</link>
